 "title": "Grain Services - Merchandising, Fertilizers &amp; Renewable Fuels - Bartlett",
 "text": "Grain Services - Merchandising, Fertilizers & Renewable Fuels - Bartlett\nGrain Services - Merchandising, Fertilizers & Renewable Fuels - Bartlett\nSkip to main content\nContact Us\nGrain\nCash Bids\nFertilizers\nRenewable Fuels\nPricing Programs\nMilling\nFood Safety\nMilling Locations\nProcessing\nAbout\nCompany\nSuppliers\nNews\nLocations\nCareers\nGraduates\nInternships\nSustainability\nCustomer Portal\nBartlett\n-->\nContact Us\nGrain\nCash Bids\nFertilizers\nRenewable Fuels\nPricing Programs\nMilling\nFood Safety\nMilling Locations\nProcessing\nAbout\nCompany\nSuppliers\nNews\nLocations\nCareers\nGraduates\nInternships\nSustainability\nCustomer Portal\nBartlett\nGrain\nGrain Merchandising for Producers and End Users\nBartlett provides grain merchandising principally in the United States and Mexico serving both producers and end users. Our network of facilities spreads through the heartland of U.S. production giving us an in-depth knowledge of U.S crops and conditions. Our expertise in logistics and transportation and our extensive rail shuttle capacity enable us to efficiently link producers to end users in a timely manner.\nFind Your Facility\nYour Trusted Supplier\nBartlett is a trusted supplier of all classes of wheat, feed grains, food grade corn and soybeans. Flour millers, corn processors, feed millers and soybean processors depend on us for timely delivery of quality grains. We also provide merchandising and logistics resources to ethanol plants and end users of distillers’ grains.\nBartlett’s disciplined approach to risk management and hedging makes us a reliable partner in ever-changing markets. We are committed to seeking growth opportunities that can enhance our services.\nMilling & Feed Oats\nBartlett originates high-quality oats and serves milling and feed customers across North America. Through our logistics network, we can offer delivery by rail or truck from our various locations to meet your specific needs. From oat mills to feed mills to equestrian operations, you can depend on Bartlett to serve your whole oat needs.\nContact Us\nFamily Owned Since 1907\nSince 1907, Bartlett has built a network of storage and handling facilities throughout the Midwest. This origination network gives Bartlett the market knowledge, capacity and logistics expertise to manage supply chain risk effectively and to meet the diverse needs of our customers.\nGrain Bids\nGet real-time grain bids at each of Bartlett’s facilities.\nFind Your Facility\nCopyright © 2026 Bartlett, a Savage Company. Privacy Policy",
